        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "愛犬のポチに「ちんちん！」と言うと、器用に後ろ足で立ってエサをねだる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "隣の家の犬は、ちんちんをしながら尻尾を振るのが得意技だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "ドッグショーで、トイプードルが完璧なちんちんを披露して拍手を浴びた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "gloss": "juvenile black porgy",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "釣り上げたのは立派なクロダイかと思ったが、まだ小さなちんちんだった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "堤防でサビキ釣りをしていたら、ちんちんがたくさん釣れて子供たちが喜んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「今日はちんちんばかりだな。もっと大きな獲物を狙いたいんだけどね」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
